Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning bright for what's ahead, you\Nsee, is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The best that we know with tears and\Ndoubts and tone. We'll go where we all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,wanna go The page within brings colors
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of our own. Oh no. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.14,0:02:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no. Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no. Be on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just gonna shoot lasers at me\Nall day? I won't stop till I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that rapid-fire laser\Ncrap is a real pain Franky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,would love to get his hands\Non that I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Final check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No turning back. Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have another babe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's gonna get ugly and Curly\NBrowse can't handle this fight on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have an ounce of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the addiction, Miyagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The patient has given\Nus the informed consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You may proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Too deep, too deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The bandages are terribly\Nthick, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so I just have to guess\Nwhere your vein is at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get them off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that would make more sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of doctor are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the small fries to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You just worry about Sasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, Iron Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys came back to lend\Nlittle old me a hand. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, armored division.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're being controlled by someone\Nright now, but it's still a mutiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's punishable by death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam, I thought I was kicking ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't have one scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stubborn, ain't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for you, so I'm\Ngonna give you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can back off, or\Nyou can die right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, our subordinates on\Nthe performance floor have all defected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm done wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go butcher all those traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You are one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I raised you to protect the land\Nof Wado in my stead, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think\Na good father would do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a bad child for\Neating that Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked hard for that, and\Nit wasn't intended for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was starving to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I was happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.84,0:06:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go out to sea,\Nand now I can't even swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Again and again I've tried\Nand failed to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.18,0:06:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But every time you struck me\Ndown, I've come back stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's kept me on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't those handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here to fight for\Nthe freedom of this country
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I mustn't falter. For I am Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fired up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tear straight\Nthrough you Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your man-beast form that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch close cause this'll be quick
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Trick mechanism
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your little\Ntwirling sword scares me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am moving an inch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this iron bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And we got your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I got this, okay? Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go help anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you want them out of the way,\NI'll be more than happy to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any allies\Nanymore, so I can let loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a triceracopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dyrus was ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, this is bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dangerous iron pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about yourselves\Nif you don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell is there a sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think he could fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta change my strategy even quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General Floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't teach this in science\Nbooks, but this is a Triceratops power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They really undersold you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing to get a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,charge okay ready come at me, bro
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding me? Did this guy\Nforget how propellers work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I must add, it's spinning\Nthe wrong way if you turn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,clockwise you're gonna go in\Nreverse man this is awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I do I gotta tell him\Nhow his own body operates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Secured runway as planned
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shut up a longer charge\Nmakes for a stronger charge
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:11:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, he's about to stop his\Nlock and he's sick of the blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,General...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the captain when you meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His lungs have been cleared, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's anything\Nelse we can do for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain would give him some medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, an injection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he's breathing again thank goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your skin is as tough as\Narmor, and if that cut
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,on your belly is any sign\Nyou're not invincible
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this should do it, Franken-sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,V for victory, play!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe don't advertise\Nit next time, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly super when\Nit comes to sword fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm gonna have to bust\Nout my super duper final finisher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep going this way, I'm going\Nto lead him to the performance floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to make my stand here and\Nnow before it gets any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's fight there, cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:13:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Portable version!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't defeat the Toby Robo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.54,0:14:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We strike fear into the hearts\Nof all who face us, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you down with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnum Seroton!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Locked and loaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wraithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Radical B!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The dog-dog fruit, mythical type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your model is Okichi no Makami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a treasure you have stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've become Wano's guardian deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,absurd to think that my\Ntreasure was eaten by
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,someone who calls himself\Nodin but it doesn't have to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,be a mistake protect rano\Nfor me be its guardian
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,deity just like i asked you\Nto no that's a sick joke
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Odochi has a talent for exploitation,\NI'll give him that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He made this whole\Ncountry a weapons factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:16:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have plenty of slaves here.\NThey'll bend to your will, easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I shall open the borders of Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to set everyone free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just the Samurai But all the people of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano will join the world\Nafter all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't wait. You're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:17:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll enter dreams right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I fear this is no ordinary fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, you sure have grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you've become\Na fine archaeologist, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give your mother a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Illusion Mist, full of sweet memories\Nto tear you apart from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Robin? Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it is enticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This illusion is a mirror after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirror that reflects my childish heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are fighting\Nfor their lives right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hardly time to reminisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Saw would never say such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,History is a treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mankind's guiding light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Illuminating us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not some illusion that\Nyou wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tres Mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.72,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The illusion didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she see through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.36,0:20:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You really had me worried back there\NRobin could have given me a heads up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that you were on to them but you know\Nthank you for your concern Brooke I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,appreciate it but I could never lose to\Nsomeone who would dare use my memories
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Against me? Truly despicable. Impossible!\NThe illusionist should work on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they just waltz right through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Niko, I'm surprised at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you'd\Nbe of your own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a horrible woman you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.10,0:20:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is way too scary for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm a corpse! Leave us\Nalone! Leave us alone! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to see\Nthrough the illusions too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, they were quite\Ncruel, but I'm used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trapped in that mist for 50 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,wishing I would wake up from my\Nnightmare and find my friends alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see visions like that every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.18,0:21:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you learn to live with pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I think you and\NI have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we both found our way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:21:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Yudo! Slave swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.84,0:22:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She's using that wheel's weapon again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually shocked you two\Ndidn't fall for my illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you're clearly\Nliving in a dream world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you could ever be Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.82,0:22:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider-Nex!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.68,0:22:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that, Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire floor is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Naccomplishing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to burn\Ndown the whole castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.62,0:22:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried about our castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't you\Nbe a good girl and surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you keep holding on to me\Nfor a moment, if you'd be so kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that weapon is a living thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can work with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.82,0:23:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Yudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Yudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind, but\NI don't do well in the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.20,0:23:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This calls for a soul break.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.04,0:23:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.84,0:24:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't know when to quit, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.86,0:24:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend sold you out so that he could\Nescape, and then he left you here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg knew you were my target, but he\Nstill called for you when I asked him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest pirates in the\Nworld all have their eyes on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's turned you into a\Nliability to your crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.68,0:24:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg couldn't wait to get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.52,0:24:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.18,0:24:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.22,0:24:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he's the\Nlaughingstock of the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.24,0:24:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,island pathetic worm his bounty's rather
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.50,0:24:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,high second highest in your crew right\Nthat doesn't reflect too well on the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,of you oh that's sanji he sure is
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:25:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,something else all right\Nrobin shall i leave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.10,0:25:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This particular foe to you. I'm glad you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,asked that sounds lovely\Ngood because these
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.32,0:25:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,ladies need my attention if you'll excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.80,0:25:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,me i have a bone to pick with them did
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,i hurt your feelings not at all sanji is
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,kinder than you think you don't need to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,understand why he asked for my help and\Nyou don't need to know how much that means
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.24,0:25:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to me but you should know when the new king\Nof the pirates soars he'll be one of his
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.22,0:25:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.96,0:25:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pigante Blur!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,someone's angry that certainly is an\Nimpressive trick you've pulled out but
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks exhausting no need to worry\Nit'll all be over before you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,now sea serpent snap dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.80,0:26:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.30,0:26:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.66,0:26:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.32,0:26:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd just stand\Nhere and let you beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So hitting these arms\Nhurts your real body, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.22,0:27:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've turned yourself into\Nsuch a nice big target.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.16,0:27:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So much to jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.64,0:27:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I hardly know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.30,0:27:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Light what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.76,0:27:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are poison bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.60,0:27:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maria Nett!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.96,0:27:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,More meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.34,0:27:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,More meat! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.54,0:27:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Better give him what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.02,0:27:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already eaten all the\Nprovisions on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.64,0:27:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and have you noticed where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.32,0:27:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think\Nthey have a butcher shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.60,0:27:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.72,0:27:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How did your crew find Luffy Toto?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.76,0:27:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell into the sea. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.86,0:28:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw him sinking and\Npicked him up in our sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.42,0:28:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you really did survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.50,0:28:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.58,0:28:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.06,0:28:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You fall down too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.46,0:28:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, or rather we escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.04,0:28:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu flew us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.96,0:28:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I peril'd Titus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.24,0:28:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku and Kin'emon, they helped us play.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.10,0:28:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They protected us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.76,0:28:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Master King.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.88,0:28:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You always do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it for later!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the leader of the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.14,0:28:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.22,0:28:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a battle to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.14,0:28:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta beat Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.20,0:28:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No crying until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.92,0:28:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking to him like that\Nis only making it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.06,0:28:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us some backbone. Be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.58,0:28:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be Shogun someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.06,0:29:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.16,0:29:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move! I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.78,0:29:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.90,0:29:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all stop yelling\Nand look for some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.84,0:29:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.48,0:29:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.50,0:29:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's at death's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad, really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to me if he dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.04,0:29:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't account for this in my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.82,0:29:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be stuck in this hellhole\Ncountry without a friend in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.60,0:29:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need him to survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.24,0:29:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.26,0:29:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need you to take\Nme back to Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.26,0:29:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn into a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.60,0:29:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.54,0:29:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.64,0:29:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.82,0:30:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
